WEBVTT

00:08:59.261 --> 00:09:03.319
(Applause)

00:09:03.343 --> 00:09:07.207
Every given project, for me,
is an opportunity

00:09:07.231 --> 00:09:11.311
to create more green cracks
through this concrete jungle

00:09:12.441 --> 00:09:16.902
by using landscape architecture
as a solution,

00:09:16.926 --> 00:09:22.041
like turning this concrete roof
into an urban farm,

00:09:22.065 --> 00:09:25.064
which can help absorb rain;

00:09:25.088 --> 00:09:27.248
reduce urban heat island

00:09:27.272 --> 00:09:29.676
and grow food in the middle of the city;